Indigomine
==========
This theme is a modified version of "Bleuclair" (farend / redmine_theme_farend_bleuclair),
licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.0 (GPLv2).

Original: https://github.com/farend/redmine_theme_farend_bleuclair (tag 0.4.4)
  — the upstream repository includes the SCSS source. Indigomine modifies the
    compiled CSS/JS distributed here.

Modifications by zero-platform-lab (2026):
  - Indigo (blue-violet) recolor of header gradient, links and accents.
  - Light-yellow highlights (hover / issue box / cards / TOC) changed to lavender.
  - Tracker-colored issue ID tags in lists (indigo family per tracker); colored status text.
  - Two-part "picker" chip for the issue detail title (tracker + number) via theme.js.
  - Modern font stack (BIZ UDPGothic / system-ui), rounded cards, lighter borders, row hover.
  - Simple Gantt plugin colors follow the theme through CSS variables.

As a derivative work, Indigomine is also distributed under GPLv2. The upstream
LICENSE (GPLv2) is retained in this directory.
